        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-07T16:42:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That smp_store_release does not look useful. This function is protected by a spinlock and no-one else is reading that vm_avail_bitmap.\n\nAlso we\u0027ve set already vm_avail_bitmap for all the SPs. Is there any point using that NOTIFIED_ALL?",
      "revId": "3f52acc51e52460793d729815c7525273e7a46de",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "75703b62_ec6aa5bf",
